WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.629 --> 00:00:16.752
"Oof!" Zann grunted as he and his friends landed on something soft.

2
00:00:16.772 --> 00:00:18.672
"Where are we?"

3
00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:19.652
Perda cried.

4
00:00:19.672 --> 00:00:24.014
"Help!" "Hush, children," said a voice from the darkness.

5
00:00:24.734 --> 00:00:26.134
It didn't sound like a troll.

6
00:00:26.494 --> 00:00:27.675
But Zann jumped to his feet.

7
00:00:27.695 --> 00:00:29.995
"Ouch!" Darb yelped.

8
00:00:30.015 --> 00:00:31.516
"Who stepped on my hand?"

9
00:00:32.456 --> 00:00:33.872
"Sorry," Zann said.

10
00:00:33.892 --> 00:00:36.193
A flame flickered to life.

11
00:00:37.034 --> 00:00:40.835
Zann squinted, barely making out a human-shaped shadow behind it.

12
00:00:41.555 --> 00:00:43.916
Whoever it was didn't look like a troll either.

13
00:00:43.936 --> 00:00:45.317
"Who's there?"

14
00:00:45.717 --> 00:00:47.498
he asked, trying to sound brave.

15
00:00:47.518 --> 00:00:50.539
"Don't be frightened, my young friends."

16
00:00:51.399 --> 00:00:56.641
The torch grew brighter, revealing the person behind the voice: a Red around Boz's age.

17
00:00:57.422 --> 00:01:02.504
His gray-streaked hair stuck up in all directions, as if it were trying to escape from his head.

18
00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:06.942
His bright blue eyes were shaded by huge, bushy brows.

19
00:01:06.962 --> 00:01:08.463
"Who are you?"

20
00:01:08.843 --> 00:01:11.405
Perda stared at the old man's multicolored robe.

21
00:01:12.145 --> 00:01:15.787
It was a little too short, ending just above his bony ankles.

22
00:01:16.548 --> 00:01:17.388
The man smiled.

23
00:01:17.408 --> 00:01:19.449
"My name is Teplo."

24
00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:21.130
Zann gasped.

25
00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:27.334
"Teplo? But that woman upstairs said—" "That's Fala, my assistant."

26
00:01:28.054 --> 00:01:30.836
Teplo set the torch in a wall bracket and lit two more.

27
00:01:32.488 --> 00:01:35.110
"She's under strict orders to say I've been taken."

28
00:01:35.891 --> 00:01:36.952
He peered at Zann.

29
00:01:37.272 --> 00:01:39.334
"You're Boz's grandson, aren't you?

30
00:01:40.054 --> 00:01:43.017
You look just like the blink images I've seen of you.

31
00:01:43.377 --> 00:01:44.538
Except older, of course."

32
00:01:45.519 --> 00:01:47.160
"Uh, yeah, I'm Zann.

33
00:01:47.681 --> 00:01:49.843
These are my friends Perda and Darb."

34
00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:53.165
Teplo didn't look anything like Zann had imagined.

35
00:01:53.826 --> 00:01:58.170
He'd been expecting someone more like the king—tall, handsome, and strong.

36
00:01:58.190 --> 00:02:00.832
"Charmed to make your acquaintance."

37
00:02:01.524 --> 00:02:03.165
Teplo made an elaborate bow.

38
00:02:03.185 --> 00:02:06.546
"My apologies for the abruptness of your arrival."

39
00:02:07.246 --> 00:02:09.147
Perda glanced around the underground room.

40
00:02:09.167 --> 00:02:12.028
"Did you open a trapdoor to get us down here?"

41
00:02:12.048 --> 00:02:13.309
"I did."

42
00:02:14.409 --> 00:02:15.150
Teplo chuckled.

43
00:02:15.170 --> 00:02:18.711
"I built the trapdoor years ago as an experiment.

44
00:02:19.391 --> 00:02:22.793
When I heard you mention Boz, I thought perhaps I should use it."

45
00:02:23.913 --> 00:02:26.394
He hurried to a corner of the room and yanked on a rope.

46
00:02:27.175 --> 00:02:30.396
Somewhere overhead the kids heard the muffled sound of a bell ringing.

47
00:02:31.108 --> 00:02:33.609
"Fala will be along soon with food and drink."

48
00:02:34.330 --> 00:02:35.951
Teplo grabbed a bowl from a table.

49
00:02:35.971 --> 00:02:39.273
"In the meantime you can snack on these turnip cookies."

50
00:02:40.173 --> 00:02:41.334
Perda wrinkled her nose.

51
00:02:41.354 --> 00:02:42.955
"Turnip cookies?"

52
00:02:44.255 --> 00:02:47.677
Zann's stomach grumbled and he realized none of them had eaten that day.

53
00:02:48.437 --> 00:02:49.378
He reached for a cookie.

54
00:02:49.398 --> 00:02:51.299
"How'd you dodge the trolls?"

55
00:02:51.719 --> 00:02:54.561
he asked Teplo, cautiously nibbling on the cookie.

56
00:02:55.401 --> 00:02:57.863
It tasted like dirt mixed with swamp water.

57
00:02:57.883 --> 00:03:00.024
"It wasn't easy."

58
00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:03.041
Teplo held up a cookie, staring at it thoughtfully.

59
00:03:03.061 --> 00:03:07.224
"I had to call upon my old friend the turnip for help."

60
00:03:08.504 --> 00:03:10.465
Zann and his friends traded a glance.

61
00:03:11.246 --> 00:03:16.249
So far Teplo seemed pretty weird, with his crazy clothes and his talk about turnips.

62
00:03:16.949 --> 00:03:21.732
Could he really be the great Magic Master whom Zann had heard stories about all his life?

63
00:03:21.752 --> 00:03:24.293
"Um, the turnip?"

64
00:03:24.693 --> 00:03:25.654
Perda said politely.

65
00:03:26.334 --> 00:03:27.014
Teplo nodded.

66
00:03:27.034 --> 00:03:29.576
"The turnip comes from another world originally.

67
00:03:30.312 --> 00:03:31.333
Did you know that?"

68
00:03:32.433 --> 00:03:33.513
The kids shook their heads.

69
00:03:33.533 --> 00:03:35.274
"It's true."

70
00:03:35.614 --> 00:03:36.435
Teplo continued.

71
00:03:36.455 --> 00:03:40.556
"That gives it great power if one knows how to harness it."

72
00:03:41.317 --> 00:03:44.478
Zann wasn't interested in wasting time talking about turnips.

73
00:03:45.258 --> 00:03:47.419
They had to find Gliss before it was too late.

74
00:03:47.439 --> 00:03:52.081
"We tried to visit Lonz and Saffa, but they're both gone," he said.

75
00:03:52.101 --> 00:03:54.302
"Unless they're in hiding too?"

76
00:03:54.662 --> 00:03:55.843
Perda asked hopefully.

77
00:03:55.863 --> 00:03:58.704
"No, they're gone," Teplo said.

78
00:03:59.140 --> 00:04:01.381
"Only a few of us remain free.

79
00:04:02.122 --> 00:04:05.944
Of course none of us can use magic, so it's difficult to keep track."

80
00:04:07.004 --> 00:04:09.826
"I guess you figured out that Morb can track people through their magic?"

81
00:04:10.126 --> 00:04:10.706
Darb asked.

82
00:04:11.427 --> 00:04:13.028
"Indeed," said Teplo.

83
00:04:13.048 --> 00:04:18.731
"Morb is using a very old form of magic that was banned long ago by the Red Council.

84
00:04:19.451 --> 00:04:22.253
But it's easy to detect if you know what to look for.

85
00:04:22.993 --> 00:04:25.234
Now tell me your story, young friends."

86
00:04:26.455 --> 00:04:28.176
Zann only hesitated for a moment.

87
00:04:28.512 --> 00:04:30.173
Yes, Teplo was odd.

88
00:04:30.754 --> 00:04:34.816
But he was Boz's friend and Zann and his friends clearly needed help from someone.

89
00:04:34.836 --> 00:04:39.679
"It all started when an echo crow came to school Zann began.

90
00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:43.642
With help from the others, he told Teplo the whole story.

91
00:04:44.323 --> 00:04:47.925
The old man listened carefully, not saying a word until they were finished.

92
00:04:47.945 --> 00:04:51.848
"Very interesting," Teplo said then.

93
00:04:51.868 --> 00:04:54.409
"Does anyone else know you're in First City?"

94
00:04:54.429 --> 00:04:59.184
"Just Slib and Yog and the others at the palace," Zann said.

95
00:04:59.204 --> 00:05:02.906
"Plus Lonz's daughter and Saffa's husband, I guess.

96
00:05:04.047 --> 00:05:05.528
We didn't tell them who we were though."

97
00:05:06.508 --> 00:05:11.451
"Don't forget that strange old woman we talked to in Wormwood when we first arrived," Darb said.

98
00:05:12.252 --> 00:05:12.892
Zann nodded.

99
00:05:13.572 --> 00:05:15.333
Darb was very logical and thorough.

100
00:05:16.014 --> 00:05:18.055
It figured he'd remember that brief encounter.

101
00:05:18.695 --> 00:05:19.676
Teplo leaned forward.

102
00:05:19.696 --> 00:05:24.819
"Wormwood?" he echoed, his blue eyes suddenly sharp with interest.

103
00:05:25.779 --> 00:05:27.180
"What old woman?"

104
00:05:28.244 --> 00:05:31.686
"Just some crazy old lady near the big tree," Zann said.

105
00:05:31.706 --> 00:05:35.467
"She wanted to trade us some disguises for Zing."

106
00:05:35.487 --> 00:05:38.588
"That's Zann's pet dragon," Darb explained.

107
00:05:38.608 --> 00:05:40.469
"They took Zing from us at the palace."

108
00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:42.490
Teplo didn't seem to hear him.

109
00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:44.511
"Wyssa," he muttered.

110
00:05:44.531 --> 00:05:46.572
"This could be trouble."

111
00:05:47.252 --> 00:05:48.333
"Huh?" Zann said.

112
00:05:48.353 --> 00:05:49.513
"Who's Wyssa?"

113
00:05:50.554 --> 00:05:52.935
Teplo waved a hand, his eyes calm again.

114
00:05:52.955 --> 00:05:54.395
"Never mind.

115
00:05:54.735 --> 00:05:56.116
Talking to myself," he said.

116
00:05:56.840 --> 00:05:58.861
"Now where's Fala with our food?"

117
00:05:59.621 --> 00:06:01.701
If the others responded, Zann didn't hear it.

118
00:06:02.382 --> 00:06:04.802
A sudden wave of strong emotion overcame him.

119
00:06:05.542 --> 00:06:07.963
He grabbed the back of a chair to keep from falling down.

120
00:06:09.043 --> 00:06:10.804
Finally he blinked and looked up.

121
00:06:11.144 --> 00:06:12.424
The others were staring at him.

122
00:06:12.444 --> 00:06:14.485
"A Red Share, huh?"

123
00:06:14.965 --> 00:06:15.525
Teplo said.

124
00:06:15.545 --> 00:06:17.266
"Was it from Boz?"

125
00:06:17.586 --> 00:06:18.166
Perda asked.

126
00:06:18.186 --> 00:06:19.606
"This could be important!

127
00:06:20.446 --> 00:06:26.661
Shares can only be felt if the two people are near each other, so that means—" "N-no!"

128
00:06:26.681 --> 00:06:27.303
Zann stammered.
